    <string name="redaction_dialog_title">Fix redacted notifications</string>
    <string name="redaction_dialog_message">Android 15+ can mark messages that contain codes as \u201Csensitive\u201D and hide their text from notification listeners (shown as \u201Csensitive notification content hidden\u201D). This is tied to the \u201CSuggest actions and replies for notifications\u201D / \u201CEnhanced notifications\u201D setting.\n\nTo let this app turn that setting off for you, grant it permission once via adb:\n\nadb shell pm grant %1$s android.permission.WRITE_SECURE_SETTINGS\n\nThen reopen this app and tap the button again. You can also turn off \u201CEnhanced notifications\u201D manually under system notification settings.</string>
